BT /F2 12.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 671.38 Tm (3.2 Pipework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 654.62 Tm (Fit isolating valves on both sides of the pump. The suction pipe must rise continuously towards the pump to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 641.62 Tm (avoid air pockets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 621.62 Tm (Tighten the flange bolts crosswise to a torque of 45 Nm. Support the pipes so that their weight does not rest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 608.62 Tm (on the pump housing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 582.25 Tm (3.3 Electrical connection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 565.50 Tm (Protect the supply with a 16 A type C circuit breaker. The motor has built-in thermal protection and does not) Tj ET
